 (text "ESC interface: VM pads, COMM header, servo-signal input" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (thickness 0.5) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "39229ff0-7b64-5943-af50-ace0d6fd1f52"))
(text "FSESC (Mini 6.7 Pro) power: 12 AWG (or an XT60 pigtail) soldered into J901/J902 at the X=0 edge, the ESC-" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "ec08d2e6-80de-5771-a7fb-5cd31d8c8f0b"))
(text "pad beside the pack BAT- return. The FSESC has no enable input; the main switch is its E-stop." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "112315e1-7210-5203-8c18-c31ba5147854"))
(text "COMM 7-pin JST-PH: 1 3V3 (not used), 2 GND, 3 TX, 4 RX, 5 ADC1 (not used), 6 ADC2, 7 PPM (not used)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 43.18000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "571e0976-a16f-5241-91cc-d07fca09a5d3"))
(text "PIN ORDER UNVERIFIED: read the FSESC silkscreen before crimping; the crimps can be re-ordered in the housing." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 48.260000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "3452ef68-da0d-5a5e-b643-64803dcb7a2c"))
(text "ADC2 = VESC_KILL through 1k (VESC kill switch \"ADC2 low\", 1.65 V threshold; 0 V = kill). 100k pull-down." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "42e54d8b-88dc-5d67-8311-567e5d93c4d2"))
(text "SERVO_IN: the FSESC servo/PPM output (3.3 V) -> 10k -> 74HCT08 buffer (5 V) -> 220 Ohm -> servo header." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 58.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "e1b0a1fc-35d2-550c-939e-6ed493458c82"))
(text "Review M6: the FSESC signal grounds (COMM pin 2, the servo lead, its USB) run beside its ESC- lead, which drops" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 63.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "41fa4417-0630-5b7b-8dd1-eb68593b5039"))
(text "about 90 mV at 90 A. Each goes to GND through 3.3 Ohm: 20-30 mA of loop current instead of amps, and the" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 68.58000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "45f6f75e-0758-5fde-adc9-09eb1f61d8bd"))
(text "resistor opens like a fuse if the ESC- joint fails. Run ESC+ and ESC- as one strain-relieved pair." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 73.66 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "c6c2668f-e8d9-5240-885c-fe37a4617691"))
